[{"result":{"data":{"json":{"id":"157","stub":{"id":"157","section":"Nichols Rd. to Granger Rd.","altname":"","river":"Rocky, N. Br. of the W. Br.","difficulty":"IItoIII","states":["USA-OHI"]},"primaryGaugeStatus":{"status":"below-recommended","latestReading":{"value":"335","dateTime":"2026-05-12T02:45:00.000Z","qualifier":"NORMAL"},"metric":"cfs","adjustedDifficulty":null},"pointOfInterests":[{"type":"put-in","description":"The putin is located on Nichols road.\nThere is a small pull-off big enough for two cars. You can park and unload here.","id":"396","location":{"latitude":"0","longitude":"0"},"name":"Putin","distance":"0","photoID":null,"difficulty":null,"approximate":false},{"type":"playspot","description":"After some warm up rapids, you come to log cabin rapids. There is a ledge at the top, that has a surf wave on river left. At the bottom underneath the bridge, there is a 3 foot ledge with a ugly hole. Run this left, or extreme right.","id":"395","location":{"latitude":"0","longitude":"0"},"name":"log cabin rapids","distance":"0.3","difficulty":"II+","approximate":false,"photoID":null},{"type":"playspot","description":"This is the best rapid on the run. Prior to the drop, there is about 300 yards of playful surfing waves. When you see the bridge, catch an eddy on river right. From here you can boat scout the rapid. Directly under the bridge, there is 6 ft slide. At lower levels, it is save to run it anywhere, but at higher levels there is a river wide hole. You can run it either extreme left or right.\n At the bottom there is an intimidating but playful hole with eddy service.","id":"397","location":{"latitude":"0","longitude":"0"},"name":"Terror Rapids","distance":"3","difficulty":"III","approximate":false,"photoID":null},{"type":"takeout","description":"The Take out is located on Granger road. Take out above the dam, and walk accross the road to the parking lot. There is a park across from the water treatment plant that has plenty of parking.","id":"398","